  "ingredients": [
    "8 tablespoon butter (salted)",
    "2 large egg",
    "2 tablespoon stevia/erythritol blend (such as Swerve)",
    "3/4 cup coconut flour",
    "6 ounce cream cheese (softened)",
    "3/4 cup stevia/erythritol blend (such as Swerve)",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 teaspoon ground allspice",
    "1/2 teaspoon ground ginger",
    "1 1/4 cup pumpkin puree",
    "3 large egg",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "In a large mixing bowl, beat the butter, eggs, and sweetener.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts/#wprm-recipe-50469-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/11/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowly add in the coconut flour, mixing the dough until it reaches a workable consistency. Cover with plastic wrap and refrigerate for 20–30 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts/#wprm-recipe-50469-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/11/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 400F. Once cooled, roll the dough out on parchment paper until about 1/4\" thick.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts/#wprm-recipe-50469-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/11/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts-13.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill a greased cupcake pan with the dough. Bake for 5–6 minutes, or until the edges begin to turn golden brown. Remove from oven and turn the oven down to 350F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts/#wprm-recipe-50469-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/11/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts-14.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the cream cheese in a mixing bowl and beat until creamed and fluffy.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts/#wprm-recipe-50469-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/11/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts-15.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, mix the sweetener, cinnamon, allspice, and ground ginger.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts/#wprm-recipe-50469-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/11/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts-18.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the pumpkin puree to the cream cheese mixture and beat together well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts/#wprm-recipe-50469-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/11/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts-19.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the dry ingredient mixture, eggs, and vanilla to the cream cheese mixture and mix well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts/#wprm-recipe-50469-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/11/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts-21.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill the partially baked pastry shells with the pumpkin cheesecake mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts/#wprm-recipe-50469-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/11/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts-22.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 15–20 minutes, or until the edges of the crust are beginning to turn brown. Let cool.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts/#wprm-recipe-50469-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/11/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts-16.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully remove the tarts from the cupcake tray — the crust is a little crumbly. Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts/#wprm-recipe-50469-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/11/low-carb-pumpkin-cheesecake-tarts-22.jpg"
    }
  ],
